      "text": [
        ":\nقُلْتُ لَهُ شَيْءٌ يَقُولُهُ اَلنَّاسُ إِنَّ أَكْثَرَ أَهْلِ اَلنَّارِ يَوْمَ اَلْقِيَامَةِ اَلنِّسَاءُ قَالَ \"وَ أَنَّى ذَلِكَ وَ قَدْ يَتَزَوَّجُ اَلرَّجُلُ فِي اَلْآخِرَةِ أَلْفاً مِنْ نِسَاءِ اَلدُّنْيَا فِي قَصْرٍ مِنْ دُرَّةٍ وَاحِدَةٍ\"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.4627 - Al-Fudayl narrated from Abu Abdullah (as). I said to Imam (as):\n\"There is something people say, that most of the inhabitants of Hell on the Day of Judgment will be women.\"\nImam (as) replied: \"How can that be, when a man may marry a thousand women of this world in the Hereafter, all within a single palace made of one pearl?\""
        ]
      }
    },
